&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Core BI team at DoorDash builds and operates the services, integrations and automation that power business intelligence across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt. Our platforms help analysts, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Software Engineers and business teams discover trusted data and make informed decisions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine software engineering, platform ownership, and a strong user focus to make BI tooling reliable, secure, scalable and self-service. The team supports the current BI ecosystem while helping shape a more integrated experience across the DoorDash group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Core BI team, you will build and operate production systems around our BI platforms. This is a hands-on software and platform engineering role focused on backend services, APIs, integrations, automation, access and governance, observability, reliability, and developer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own problems from discovery through design, implementation, deployment, and operational support. You will work closely with Data Engineers, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Software Engineers, Product Managers and business teams to turn recurring user needs into durable, self-service capabilities. If you&#39;re energized by solving technical problems with data and comfortable being deeply embedded across several domains, this role is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, deploy, and operate backend services, APIs and automation supporting BI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate metadata, workspace and content lifecycle, permissions, migrations, archival, validation and other platform workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve platform availability, observability, performance, scalability and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build self-service tools that reduce manual administration and help analytics teams work more effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support platform migrations and deprecations while protecting access, governance, data integrity and business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in operational support, production debugging, incident response and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and data teams across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt to develop shared standards and platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least two years of professional software engineering experience building production backend, platform, infrastructure or data-platform systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write readable, maintainable, and well-tested code in Python or another general-purpose programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working with SQL and understand data modelling, databases, and data-platform concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building APIs, integrations, or automation and can reason about service boundaries, authentication, data contracts, and failure modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience operating software in production, including CI/CD, observability, debugging, incident response and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take end-to-end ownership and can turn ambiguous user or operational problems into secure, scalable, self-service solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly and work effectively with both technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working in a fast-paced, distributed environment and can organise your work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or integrating with BI platforms such as Looker, Sigma or comparable tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BI metadata, governance, permissions, content lifecycle, migrations or usage analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating identity and access through Okta, SCIM or role-based access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

